      "textContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Lab Task Board | Synthetic Fixture</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { color-scheme: light; font: 16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif; }\n    body { margin: 0; padding: 2rem; background: #f6f8fb; color: #17212e; }\n    main { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem; background: white; border: 1px solid #d9e1eb; border-radius: 14px; }\n    label { display: block; font-weight: 650; margin-top: 1.5rem; }\n    input { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: .7rem; border: 1px solid #8698ac; border-radius: 8px; }\n    ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }\n    .task-card { margin: .7rem 0; padding: .85rem 1rem; border: 1px solid #d9e1eb; border-radius: 8px; }\n    .task-card[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n    .task-card h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; }\n    .task-card p { margin: .2rem 0 0; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main id=\"task-board\">\n    <header id=\"protected-header\">\n      <h1 id=\"board-title\">Lab Task Board</h1>\n      <p id=\"board-subtitle\">A synthetic, offline-only accessibility benchmark.</p>\n    </header>\n    <label for=\"task-filter\">Search tasks</label>\n    <input id=\"task-filter\" name=\"task-filter\" type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-label=\"Search tasks\">\n    <p id=\"result-count\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">3 tasks</p>\n    <ul id=\"task-list\">\n      <li class=\"task-card\" id=\"task-alpha\" data-search=\"alpha research\">\n        <h2>Alpha research</h2><p>Collect three facts.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"task-card\" id=\"task-beta\" data-search=\"beta review\">\n        <h2>Beta review</h2><p>Check the evidence.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"task-card\" id=\"task-gamma\" data-search=\"gamma release\">\n        <h2>Gamma release</h2><p>Prepare a handoff.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <!-- Intentionally absent: live, case-insensitive filtering and status count updates.\n         The AI must add this behavior without removing the protected header or tasks. -->\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
